  "description": "Andert the Hero. A great swordsman who ended the great war by sacrificing himself. One of the greatest heroes of all time. But in truth, I was a woman disguised as a man, living under the identity of my dead younger brother. That was me.\nAnd then — \"Huh? I came back to life… four years after dying?\" With nothing but this body left, there was only one way to survive. A maid.\n“Which kind of household would you like to work in?” “A place so harsh and awful that even if one of two workers dies, no one would notice.” “And what kind of employer are you looking for?” “A vicious employer who squeezes their workers dry.”\nThat way, I’ll be the only one willing to work there—and they won’t be able to fire me.\n“……” The interviewer looked at me like I was completely insane. Still, it doesn’t matter. Here, I’ll start over. Not as the hero Andert. Not as my dead younger brother. But as a maid— Daisy.",
